      "text": "[9:11PM] #IyanaOworo #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic movement in Bariga, Iyana Oworo is characterized by a predominantly smooth flow, with notable efficiency on the Third Mainland Bridge, Iyana Oworo to Gbagada, and within the Bariga axis. \nWhile a military truck is currently posing a minor impediment as reported earlier, the presence of proactive traffic officers ensures that the situation remains under control, facilitating an overall appreciable traffic movement.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
