      "text": "[9:22PM] #Mushin #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is moving well from Moshalasi to Ojuwoye Post Office, AP to Oshodi underbridge, and Brown junction to Arena.\n\nSlightly busy traffic near Train station to Brown junction due to commercial activities, but traffic is moving. \n\nReturn journey from Bolade Oshodi to Ojuwoye, Mushin LUTH junction, and Moshalasi is also smooth. \n\nNo impediments recorded, with officers managing traffic effectively.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
